#: scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2416d3a935d9fb8630ceb2e6a3b78671f2e7fc28ccfb7a3949b2a0458fd274d
#. default-sha256: 1b0f42d20190f66f9cc25c1c78f6efbe41118b0c8447926f7ca8c7ed030b66c6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The mansion sat near "
"the ocean."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Le manoir se situait "
"près de l’océan."

#: scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08fff9932fded2a7a5db290c894324dd192b2bd8235c481572a16fa5d3477126
#. default-sha256: eca611fdc8e8f3596c712c25ab11cde2f36d79a8b5f62b63a07d7cd1db33b65c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫To say it was perched upon a cliff might make it sound rather intimidating..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Si je vous dis qu’il était perché sur une falaise, cela vous semblera plutôt "
"intimidant..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68d4a45dbc526491b21d807511a8f35feaebd050a701b14994bdbcb215689afe
#. default-sha256: a08576cc5fe45770c3f9edd1e174fd65ff910752614cf2995495e6afd3b7fffc
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but you could see the beautifully clear sea through the windows—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a glittering "
"expanse of emerald and turquoise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...mais on pouvait voir la mer d’une limpidité cristalline à travers les fenêtres—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ "
"telle une étendue scintillante d’émeraude et de turquoise."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9a7e56b21bd3c33b88b1ac6e6d45666ce10a8b70694d8957365992bc24fa718
#. default-sha256: b645d22c3c4cfab6bd55577e34f07ea54896ce65318fde4123c72815f02c0b76
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If the mansion had been in proper condition, it would have been breathtaking against "
"that backdrop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Si le manoir avait été dans un état correct, l’ensemble aurait été à couper le souffle."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12f1c9daf48fa6a67bcea1446409bc42888e3f372ea62563860f9d7ff14c6b62
#. default-sha256: aff0775025ea2b946ca2316fe2b6d23fb9fa94e313f018e028cee863c04dc406
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even wanted to plant orange trees in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je voulais même planter des orangers dans le jardin."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7284aa731f63108eb268b33f79e84ac381a15dd5634aa371643684511841d8c2
#. default-sha256: 7b3b59c23911c45f8a96d1840ef828ace28ef8f27e50ded2c2514dc5457c26d7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though it was a tumultuous era, the sun still shone bright upon the land, which only served "
"to emphasize the house’s unsightliness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Malgré ces temps mouvementés, le soleil persistait à briller haut dans le ciel, ce qui ne "
"faisait qu’accentuer la laideur de la maison."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c89e9de466c9429e81eba6be3d4dc204b50614c1b28124312140c1cfce7d33b
#. default-sha256: eee7af56d91de5e88f52c67aeb63700adf48312352cb04b16952aaeea9b90ef6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yes, perhaps I should give you some more background information. ⟪k:1⟫At that period in "
"time, a war had just drawn to a close."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah oui, peut-être devrais-je vous donner quelques informations supplémentaires quant au "
"contexte. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫À⟪k:3⟫ cette époque-là, la guerre venait juste de se terminer."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e95d08d3bbef52a66f11fd6ce5f049f329abbc2a4fd924d462b62c68956cca6c
#. default-sha256: f8c083f0a5953bc87a49b2bef8a55028ce6c1d69e41de26e929c5b39be97adce
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The once gorgeous wetlands were infested with crows picking at decaying "
"remains. Bodies of soldiers fallen in battle continually washed up on the shores of coastal "
"villages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Les lagunes autrefois splendides étaient infestées de corbeaux picorant "
"les restes pourrissants. Les corps des soldats tombés sur le champ de bataille étaient rejetés "
"continuellement sur les rives des villages côtiers."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ce5672e31738a46ebc95e37ec7509e8245a284d71c61022d3b2d48c14141a98
#. default-sha256: c4ba45a529ee6338cfa3333c72f3e57e41570c27d4ee51940a584b1b70dbb18e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The people wanted nothing more than for the curtain to draw on that deeply political contest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les gens souhaitaient par-dessus tout tirer un trait sur cette querelle éminemment politique."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01b8abe1be34a06fcf5ccc2a3c45b50c457a5297a87e493f50c558f7d359d424
#. default-sha256: ea82e68e0b7f3c0f61aaea9dfef5165d220113683dacee470f89c6aecdf4b0eb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And when it finally did, the kingdom, with its richly fertile shores, was stripped of its "
"independence, beginning a new era under new rule."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et quand la paix arriva, le royaume, ainsi que ses rivages très fertiles, fut dépouillé de "
"son indépendance ; ce fut le début d’une nouvelle ère sous un nouveau régime."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c8999431f13f4a750d97f0025a8eb6a817d4517a3cc98837991a6c68e0b37af
#. default-sha256: fcce5c0395cf076c2ee3f9a345358d345e3ded1b0e4f114a79f04a858825974d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The people were exhausted, their spirits wasted away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les gens étaient épuisés, leurs esprits consumés."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3eca834f82af63bc2181a8fa0b9446b76b6807561fb903eef3570df1db5adb38
#. default-sha256: fc154f497e4b86aa3c9bacd13068782a5b8abdc1b0cdcf7eaa84430b6851ccbb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the splendor of the ocean and sky did nothing to help."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et la splendeur de l’océan et du ciel n’arrangeaient rien."

#: scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40c3d5c912e9c82612366a4683ade597bc62555f840943b278a396d63ab0b583
#. default-sha256: 70e2366abc54dc85497714674ddc17c05f6ea12b0978f30f187494955359f528
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In my mind, the beast was emblematic of the times—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫emaciated and enveloped in the "
"scent of blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour moi, la bête reflétait l’esprit du temps—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ émaciée et baignant dans des "
"effluves de sang."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d848aa7853ad2bba8d0bb9e7cf41af91b7a3f6838de9e8434e7dc9580e2f82b3
#. default-sha256: 108fb10a956c6b2eb7b9273641f4aa343ec42aab58849a899c52063863141805
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the war came to an end. ⟪k:1⟫Thus the beast did not have to remain a beast, I thought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais la guerre prit fin. ⟪k:1⟫Ainsi, la bête n’avait plus à rester une bête, pensais-je."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f82a5a67a2d264bc0efb73c064952303f1904837daea316a3049b730f93144ea
#. default-sha256: b52c8aed231c475a2a7902a17abd9798eeb2c907787f4dcbbab430d643e893a8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did he?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 348bf2516617d3fd01965395ea221c8a74491a71d81ecc9db6fb25b5b6c88ee4
#. default-sha256: 9f3db6eb9f7be2b135e1e7e769b12f63c3bdd8a40ebfa718952d1ace65e04cbe
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And so, I endeavored to make the beast more human-like."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Et donc, j’entrepris de donner à la bête une apparence plus humaine."

#: scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d03c8d24109cd100f62f1d851c9cdfc1ff8459cf4e2848c0e02f54b1d029e099
#. default-sha256: 64fd70b26045a01998178716484c55f22ef33d6a7cf91c09243ec66480ab6936
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫First, I needed to do something about his appearance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫D’abord, il fallait que je fasse quelque chose pour l’arranger physiquement."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 509a991da3a2ee113ccbdfe7a70200d3d8b2fef86e56cb36e48b95db870b78e9
#. default-sha256: ac3891f1bf6aaf449172872fe59907cc64029fb4a2cd481cb69755be7c3f5561
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would draw a bath, scrub away all the filth, and dress him in clothing left in the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je lui préparai un bain, le frottai pour lui ôter toute la saleté qui le recouvrait et "
"l’habillai des vêtements qui avaient été laissés au manoir."

#: scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0f088775df59a8ce696345705e3547e5cfb8d3e5011ee6382fc6325e6a29415
#. default-sha256: 3965c1a6c8eace6fdc505e05f4ea57dfac38f4fa40baf65e173a2f7ad2623517
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, having sat unused for fifty years, the majority of garments had been devoured by "
"insects and were of little use."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cependant, comme ils n’avaient pas été utilisés depuis cinquante ans, la majorité d’entre "
"eux avait été dévorée par les mites et n’était pas d’une grande utilité."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc1addd54010109232ab7e46cfe75753646359f09c28f02189b0c59c0be51106
#. default-sha256: 0a70fcfd1d537831d2baccf1db944d7d386e988ed3a54c49371e4b8a519c4213
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I searched the mansion top to bottom for anything the beast could wear, heated up some "
"coals, and set to work ironing what I found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je fouillai alors la maison de fond en comble à la recherche d’un habit que la bête pourrait "
"porter, je chauffai quelques charbons de bois et me mis à repasser ce que j’avais trouvé."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d153097245f9f40600739311aa19ab8c25d8e7c5ebfe625739bc933329949813
#. default-sha256: eb233d5ec45e8e6f892e7d676260b5ab37c7dd30376d88e2f53bd4a82dc6059e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, steam irons had not yet been invented. We used plates of iron heated with coals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ l’époque, les fers à vapeur n’avaient pas encore été inventés. On utilisait des "
"plaques de fer chauffées par des morceaux de charbon."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bba7bfa16055edca4041f4390224b8a5313bfec776549222b11157911671c753
#. default-sha256: 0361cbe84a818596fbe0ac3fcd582bee60a79a282d5505e7192001308dc331d4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They somewhat resembled kettles."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elles ressemblaient un peu à des bouilloires."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cae3ed44e6429c98edf07dec397f9fd3890e28d67660cf748bb3e6ee1f6b0644
#. default-sha256: bd35117b1ac895757b2820cf1a68ba241c3a57c3e05e9af0c012c550ef51555e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I even prepared meals for the beast, in order to teach him proper table "
"manners."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Je préparais même à la bête des plats cuisinés afin de lui apprendre à se "
"tenir à table."

#: scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52489f505e3b5f567e6cd107064c290c10d0fd2339df6182bc88803a5498d04f
#. default-sha256: e66cf18df1fc297922b93c4bd06a700f460fe6a95caa53b792cc58cb8b7886ef
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although, with the mansion in a nearly uninhabitable state of disarray, there was only so "
"much I could do in the kitchen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais c’était compliqué d’utiliser la cuisine, en raison de l’état presque inhabitable du "
"manoir."

#: scenario2:scenario2_44DCF1A1_DCDB_4D0D_85B8_19709B8DCE59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61e97017437da5a56762ee75353041cafd569aa17d2dd498b310600bfdf53831
#. default-sha256: 3a3fda408815e5725358677af03f14fc8a4ae4e786bd5dce774fedd72aa2dd6c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_44DCF1A1_DCDB_4D0D_85B8_19709B8DCE59"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the only supplies I had to work with were what was left in the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et les seules provisions utilisables étaient celles qui étaient restées à la cave."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A48236E7_2B15_4071_9C06_0EBE6C14F04B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 733858e69c98c9672e08d3be374d8976c7316eb2602d058cef976e52d1109909
#. default-sha256: 202a5eb8b24e63a6e8994e3a8fd6dd6911edb90a5c78c613a8f34bd1e2e23442
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A48236E7_2B15_4071_9C06_0EBE6C14F04B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As such, I was not able to put to use the cooking skills I had learned in the flaxen-haired "
"family’s time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dans ces conditions, je ne pouvais pas mettre à profit les compétences culinaires que "
"j’avais acquises à l’époque de la famille aux cheveux blonds."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DDA935CC_8CFF_4500_B1F0_65752F2C3766
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae4fe92583d1a71e77f184073534862d4d3301ac8b126fcf17b2612dfc6cc55d
#. default-sha256: f31a6d7161ed8a9a1eec6780fdc34fa7d14789d6259580505b0b8c14e7c03d52
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DDA935CC_8CFF_4500_B1F0_65752F2C3766"
msgid ""
